    <h2>Pretzel Sticks with Zesty Queso: The Savory Alternative to Standard Fries</h2>
    <p>While drive-thru side menus are traditionally dominated by deep fryers, Dairy Queen carved out a dedicated fan following with its oven-baked <strong>Pretzel Sticks with Zesty Queso</strong>. Sized for comfortable one-handed dipping, these soft pretzel batons boast an authentic soft-baked texture — chewy exterior with a warm, fluffy crumb inside, lightly dusted with pretzel salt. The defining element, however, is the accompanying warm dipping cup: a smooth, creamy queso sauce carrying just enough jalapeño warmth and smoky chili notes to awaken the palate. Browse the full savory side collection on <a href="/categories/snacks-sides">Snacks &amp; Sides</a> or compare full menus on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

    <h2>Pretzel Sticks vs. Wisconsin Cheese Curds: The $3.99 Dilemma</h2>
    <p>Both priced identically at $3.99, these two items represent DQ's premier hot finger foods. Here is how their nutritional and sensory profiles compare:</p>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Pretzel Sticks with Queso</th><th>Wisconsin Cheese Curds</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Preparation Method</strong></td><td>Oven-baked bread with dipping sauce</td><td>Crispy deep-fried bite-sized nuggets</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Calories &amp; Fat</strong></td><td>440 cal (16g Total Fat)</td><td>470 cal (28g Total Fat)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Dominant Texture</strong></td><td>Pillowy, tender chew with velvety cheese dip</td><td>Shatter-crisp exterior batter with molten cheese pull</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Best Use Case</strong></td><td>Pairing with burgers or light afternoon snack</td><td>Sharing with family in the car or dining room</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2>Maximizing Value: The 2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match Strategy</h2>
    <p>At $3.99 à la carte, ordering Pretzel Sticks by themselves is a satisfying snack. However, savvy guests take advantage of Dairy Queen's <strong>2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match</strong> platform:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Pairing with an Entree:</strong> Combine Pretzel Sticks with Queso ($3.99 regular value) and an <a href="/items/original-cheeseburger">Original Cheeseburger</a> ($6.39 value) or a <a href="/items/chili-cheese-dog">Chili Cheese Dog</a> ($4.49 value).</li>
      <li><strong>The Result:</strong> You receive both items for exactly $5.00, shaving up to 50% off the total order.</li>
    </ul>

